## 五、父级 index.vue 集成

```vue
<TaktModal v-model:open="formVisible" :width="formModalWidthPx" :confirm-loading="formLoading" @ok="handleFormSubmit">
 <XxxForm ref="formRef" :form-data="formData" :loading="formLoading" />
</TaktModal>
```

```typescript
async function handleFormSubmit() {
  await formRef.value?.validate()
  const dto = formRef.value?.getValues()
  formLoading.value = true
  try {
    if (formData.value?.id) await updateXxx(formData.value.id, dto)
    else await createXxx(dto)
    formVisible.value = false
    await loadData()
  } finally {
    formLoading.value = false
  }
}
```

